Package: calivi
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Orkun Soylu <orkun-soylu@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= @PY@), python3 (<< @PYNEXT@), nginx, sudo, ca-certificates
Recommends: qemu-guest-agent
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://calivi.ai
Description: self-hosted AI chat that can operate the machine it runs on
 Calivi is a multi-user chat interface for Ollama and OpenAI-compatible model
 servers. This package is the calivi-vm build: Calivi runs natively behind
 nginx on port 80, and its first account becomes the machine's owner, whose
 chat model can run commands on this host behind approval cards.
